id: SCA-011
title: Suspicious npm lifecycle script running hidden file
category: supply-chain
severity: error
engine: pattern
target:
  filenames: package.json
  exclude_paths: test/ node_modules/ .git/ vendor/
patterns:
  - regex: "(postinstall|preinstall|install|prepare)"\s*:\s*"[^"]*(\.\/\.[^"]*|\/tmp\/|\/var\/tmp\/)
    message: Lifecycle script references hidden file or temp directory — used to evade manual code review. Attackers hide payloads in dotfiles or /tmp.
fix: Lifecycle scripts should only reference visible project files. Investigate hidden file references immediately.
